'''Wormadam''' (Japanese: '''ミノマダム''' ''Minomadam'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

