==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Wormadam}} in its {{form|Wormadam|Trash Cloak}} form.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Wormadam|59}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion; both cards have the Iron Head attack.
*{{m|Iron Head}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Wormadam}} Trash Cloak can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shining Pearl}}.

